1. Binary Search:


Code:

class Solution {
    public int search(int[] nums, int target) {
        int low=0;
        int high=nums.length-1;
        while(low<=high){
            int mid=(low+high)/2;
            if(nums[mid]==target){
                return mid;
            }
            else if(nums[mid]>target){
                high=mid-1;
            }
            else{
                low=mid+1;
            }
        }
        return -1;
    }
}



Time Complexity : O(log n)
Space Complexity: O(1)
